Package: homestead
Version: @VERSION@-@REVISION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Depends: systemd
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: customer-owned private-cloud appliance control plane
 Homestead combines a native Go daemon, CLI, dashboard, and curated Compose
 catalog for one customer-owned Linux appliance. It keeps configuration in
 inspectable YAML and operational state in SQLite; applications remain
 usable through Docker Compose without the Homestead control plane.
